monly worn by ordinary soldiers on the battlefield."},"defenceVal":"4","evade":"2","price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1023405","name":{"zh":"沿帻铁胄","en":"Veiled Iron Helm"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"在铁盔下沿缝制了巾帻，用于抵挡风沙，多为游牧民族的战士佩戴。","en":"An iron helm with cloth sewn along the lower brim to block wind and sand, commonly worn by nomadic warriors."},"defenceVal":"2","price":"800","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{},"clans":[{"id":"GI113315","name":{"zh":"新罗昔氏","en":"The Seok clan of Silla"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自辰韩部落，新罗三大王族之一。始祖昔脱解的传说具有神话色彩，相传他卵生自倭国东北的多婆那国，漂流至辰韩被收养。因“鹊”字得姓“昔”。新罗建国初期，王位在朴、昔、金三姓间轮流继承。昔氏曾有昔脱解、昔伐休等十余位国王。其执政时期属于辰韩古国史阶段。“三姓以齿长相嗣” 的继承制度，使其与朴、金两族通过联姻紧密交织。三国时期，新罗势力尚弱，影响力局限于半岛东南部。","en":"Originating from the Jinhan confederacy, this was one of the three royal houses of Silla. The lore of their progenitor, Seok Talhae, is steeped in myth: born from an egg in the realm of Tapana to the North and East of Wa, he drifted to Jinhan and was adopted, taking the surname Seok from the word for magpie. In Silla's early days, the throne rotated among the Bak, Seok, and Kim clans. The Seok clan produced over ten monarchs, including Seok Talhae and Seok Beolhyu, reigning during the ancient Jinhan era. Under the succession system where seniority among the three clans determined the heir, they were deeply intertwined with the Bak and Kim clans through marriage. During the Three Kingdoms era, Silla was still a weak Faction, its influence confined to the southeastern peninsula."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"5","politics":"6"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"昔伐休","height":"平均","shape":"精壮"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":