":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,58,70,50,54,58],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,58,70,50,54,58],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,58,70,50,54,58],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,58,70,50,54,58],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,58,70,50,54,58],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[55,58,70,50,54,58],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1005705","helmet":"WP1023405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"朝鲜半岛三国时代新罗国的第九代君主，谥号之圣王。新罗第四代君主脱解尼师今的后裔。父亲是昔仇邹，母亲是只珍内礼夫人。昔伐休是前任君主阿达罗尼师今同母异父的弟弟。阿达罗尼师今去世后无子，根据国人推举，继承王位。与百济征战，互有胜负。在位第六年，其将领金仇道曾在狗壤击败百济。曾下令州郡不得大兴土木，并巡视州郡。","tc":"朝鮮半島三國時代新羅國的第九代君主，謚號之圣王。新羅第四代君主脫解尼師今的后裔。父親是昔仇鄒，母親是只珍內禮夫人。昔伐休是前任君主阿達羅尼師今同母異父的弟弟。阿達羅尼師今去世后無子，根據國人推舉，繼承王位。與百濟征戰，互有勝負。在位第六年，其將領金仇道曾在狗壤擊敗百濟。曾下令州郡不得大興土木，并巡視州郡。","en":"The ninth Ruler of the kingdom of Silla during the Three Kingdoms of Korea period, posthumously titled King Jiseong. A descendant of Talhae Isageum, the fourth Ruler of Silla. His father was Seok Guchu, and his mother was Lady Jijin Naerye. Seok Beolhyu was the maternal half-brother of the previous Ruler, Adalla Isageum. When Adalla Isageum died without an heir, he was acclaimed by the people of the state to succeed to the throne. He waged war against Baekje with mixed fortunes. In the sixth year of his reign, his general Kim Gudo defeated Baekje at Guryang. He once decreed that the provinces and commanderies refrain from lavish construction projects, and toured the provinces and commanderies in person.","jp":"朝鮮半島三国時代の新羅第9代君主。諡号は之聖王。新羅第4代君主・脱解尼師今の末裔。父は昔仇鄒、母は只珍内礼夫人。先代君主・阿達羅尼師今の異父弟にあたる。阿達羅尼師今が嗣子なく没したため、国人の推戴を受けて王位を継承した。百済と交戦して勝敗を重ね、在位6年目には将の金仇道が狗壌にて百済を破った。また、州郡に対して大々的な土木工事を禁じ、州郡を巡視した。","kr":"한반도 삼국시대 신라의 제9대 군주로, 시호는 지성왕이다. 신라 제4대 군주 탈해 이사금의 후예다. 아버지는 석구추이며, 어머니는 지진내례부인이다. 석벌휴는 전대 군주 아달라 이사금의 이부동생이다. 아달라 이사금이 후사 없이 승하하자 국인의 추대를 받아 왕위를 계승했다. 백제와 전쟁을 치르며 승패를 주고받았다. 재위 6년에는 장수 김구도가 구양에서 백제를 격파했다. 주군에 토목공사를 크게 일으키지 말라 명하고 주군을 순시했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1049215","remark":"普武","surname":"昔","surnameTc":"昔","surnameEn":"Seok","surnameJp":"昔","surnameKr":"석","surnameOther":"","name":"伐休","nameTc":"伐休","nameEn":"Beolhyu","nameJp":"伐休","nameKr":"벌휴","nameOther":"","word":"發暉","wordTc":"發暉","wordEn":"Balhwi","wordJp":"発暉","wordKr":"발휘","wordOther":"","icon":"昔伐休","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable